# 123 - aegis-scheme-alias (user feedback 2026-11-13: "did you changed the
# path from chrome://version to Aegis://version")
# aegis:// is registered as a standard + secure scheme and every WebUI
# lookup resolves aegis://<host> to chrome://<host> before consulting the
# WebUIConfigMap. Result: aegis://version, aegis://settings, aegis://history,
# aegis://flags etc. all work AND keep working alongside chrome:// URLs.
# Pages keep their internal chrome:// base href for resources, so nothing
# inside a WebUI changes.

